---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DonateButton from '../components/DonateButton.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="For Paisley"
  description="The story behind MonkeyPayPay — a dad building apps to give his daughter Paisley the best life possible."
>
  <section class="story">
    <div class="story__banner" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container story__inner">
      <p class="story__eyebrow reveal">The story behind the name</p>
      <h1 class="story__title reveal">For Paisley</h1>

      <img
        class="story__mascot reveal anim-sway"
        src="/brand/monkey-ballet.webp"
        alt="The MonkeyPayPay mascot dancing ballet"
        width="610"
        height="760"
        loading="eager"
      />

      <div class="story__body">
        <p class="reveal">
          MonkeyPayPay isn’t a company name I dreamed up. It’s her. Paisley — my
          daughter — the little one I call <em>Monkey</em>, and <em>Pay&nbsp;Pay</em>.
          She just took her first wobbling steps across the family-room floor, and
          somehow she’s already the reason for everything you see here.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal">
          From the moment I found out I was going to be a father, something in me
          shifted. I made myself a promise — quietly, the way you make the
          promises that matter most — that I would do everything in my power to
          give her the best life I possibly could.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal">
          The world she’s growing into isn’t a cheap one, and I don’t expect it to
          get any easier. So I started building. Every app on this site is a small
          attempt to earn a little extra — money that goes toward her education,
          her childhood, and whatever she falls in love with along the way. Maybe
          that’s dance, or gymnastics. Maybe sports, or music, or the arts.
          Whatever Paisley reaches for, I want to be able to say <em>yes</em>.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal">
          If you download something and it makes your day a little better, that
          means the world to me. And if you never spend a cent — if you simply
          came here to read this — thank you. Truly. Thank you for being here.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal">
          To every family, and especially to the dads pouring themselves into that
          same quiet promise: I see you. This one’s for you, too.
        </p>

        <p class="story__sign reveal">— A dad, building for his Monkey.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="story__support reveal" id="support">
        <img
          class="story__celebrate anim-bounce"
          src="/brand/monkey-celebrate.webp"
          alt=""
          width="730"
          height="760"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <h2 class="story__support-title">Help write Paisley’s next chapter</h2>
        <p>
          Enjoying the apps, or just want to cheer us on? Anything at all helps —
          and even sharing this page means a lot.
        </p>
        <div class="story__support-actions">
          <DonateButton />
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/#apps">Browse the apps</a>
        </div>
        <p class="story__support-note">
          Questions or just want to say hi? <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
